WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.500
Use Service setup to prepare the complete programme before anyone goes live.

00:07.500 --> 00:16.500
First choose the service type. Pre-recorded Kinyarwanda uses an existing sermon file. Live from Krefeld is for a captured live programme.

00:17.500 --> 00:32.500
For a pre-recorded service, choose the opening music, Kinyarwanda recording, closing music, a visual source, and the timed sermon subtitle file. Studio saves these choices automatically.

00:33.500 --> 00:40.500
The status line lists anything still missing. Resolve every required item, confirm the chosen files, then select Done.

00:41.500 --> 00:48.500
When setup is ready, Studio can guide the operator through opening music, sermon, and closing music in the correct order.
